1e:["$","section","How to choose the right package",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl text-obs-fog md:text-4xl","children":"How to choose the right package"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-obs-fog/78","children":[["$","p","If the vehicle is in generally good shape, a maintenance-level service is usually enough. If there is embedded dirt, pet hair, stains, salt buildup, or neglected trim, a more complete detail will make a bigger difference.",{"children":"If the vehicle is in generally good shape, a maintenance-level service is usually enough. If there is embedded dirt, pet hair, stains, salt buildup, or neglected trim, a more complete detail will make a bigger difference."}],["$","p","When in doubt, the best approach is to send photos or ask for a recommendation before booking. That keeps expectations clear and helps match the package to the condition of the vehicle.",{"children":"When in doubt, the best approach is to send photos or ask for a recommendation before booking. That keeps expectations clear and helps match the package to the condition of the vehicle."}]]}],null]}]
1f:["$","section","Final thought",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl text-obs-fog md:text-4xl","children":"Final thought"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-obs-fog/78","children":[["$","p","The right mobile detailing service should save time, improve the condition of your vehicle, and make the whole process feel straightforward. That is what most drivers are really looking for.",{"children":"The right mobile detailing service should save time, improve the condition of your vehicle, and make the whole process feel straightforward. That is what most drivers are really looking for."}]]}],null]}]
